---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SIPGrowthPlanner from '../../components/calculators/SIPGrowthPlanner';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="SIP Growth Planner | Step-Up SIP Calculator | Ant Wealth Creation"
  description="Estimate how your monthly SIP, annual step-ups, and additional lump-sum investments could grow over time with effective monthly compounding."
  canonicalUrl="https://antwealth.in/tools/sip-growth"
>
  <main class="sip-page-main">
    <!-- Breadcrumb Navigation -->
    <div class="breadcrumb-container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb-nav" aria-label="Breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/" class="breadcrumb-link">Home</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb-sep">/</span>
        <a href="/tools" class="breadcrumb-link">Calculators</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb-sep">/</span>
        <span class="breadcrumb-current">SIP Growth Planner</span>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <header class="sip-header-section">
      <div class="sip-header-inner">
        <div class="sip-badge">Wealth Creation & Step-Up Strategy</div>
        <h1 class="sip-main-title">SIP Growth Planner</h1>
        <p class="sip-main-subtitle">
          See how your monthly SIP, annual step-ups and occasional lump-sum investments could compound into substantial long-term wealth.
        </p>

        <!-- Trust Badges Row -->
        <div class="trust-perks-row">
          <div class="trust-perk">
            <span class="perk-icon">🔒</span>
            <span class="perk-text">100% Confidential</span>
          </div>
          <div class="trust-perk">
            <span class="perk-icon">🛡️</span>
            <span class="perk-text">No Phone Number or Login Needed</span>
          </div>
          <div class="trust-perk">
            <span class="perk-icon">📈</span>
            <span class="perk-text">Monthly Compounding Growth</span>
          </div>
          <div class="trust-perk">
            <span class="perk-icon">💰</span>
            <span class="perk-text">Multi-Lump-Sum Planning</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Interactive Calculator Island -->
    <section class="calculator-container" aria-label="Interactive SIP Growth Planner Calculator">
      <SIPGrowthPlanner client:load />
    </section>

    <!-- Educational Guide Section -->
    <section class="edu-guide-section" aria-labelledby="edu-heading">
      <div class="edu-inner">
        <div class="edu-badge">Educational Guide</div>
        <h2 id="edu-heading" class="edu-title">How SIP Step-Ups Can Help Build Wealth</h2>
        <p class="edu-intro">
          Systematic Investment Plans (SIPs) instill financial discipline, but adding annual step-ups transforms a modest savings habit into an exponential wealth accelerator.
        </p>

        <div class="edu-grid">
          <div class="edu-card">
            <div class="edu-icon">🚀</div>
            <h3 class="edu-card-title">1. Aligning Investments with Salary Growth</h3>
            <p class="edu-card-text">
              As your career progresses, your disposable income rises. By stepping up your SIP by 10% each year, you naturally prevent lifestyle inflation from absorbing your annual salary increments and bonuses.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="edu-card">
            <div class="edu-icon">⏳</div>
            <h3 class="edu-card-title">2. Compounding Over Time</h3>
            <p class="edu-card-text">
              Albert Einstein famously called compound interest the eighth wonder of the world. In the early years, your total contributions make up most of your portfolio. In later years, the compounding returns dwarf your annual contributions.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="edu-card">
            <div class="edu-icon">💎</div>
            <h3 class="edu-card-title">3. The Power of Occasional Lump Sums</h3>
            <p class="edu-card-text">
              Annual performance bonuses, tax refunds, or maturing fixed deposits can be injected as occasional lump sums. When added early in your investment horizon, each ₹1 lakh has years to compound exponentially.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="edu-card">
            <div class="edu-icon">🛡️</div>
            <h3 class="edu-card-title">4. Post-SIP Horizon Compounding</h3>
            <p class="edu-card-text">
              Even after you stop making fresh monthly contributions, leaving your accumulated corpus untouched allows your entire capital base to compound without disruption, significantly boosting your final corpus.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Cross-Discovery Navigation -->
    <section class="cross-discovery-section" aria-labelledby="tools-heading">
      <div class="cross-inner">
        <h2 id="tools-heading" class="cross-title">Explore Other Financial Planning Suites</h2>
        <p class="cross-subtitle">Discover comprehensive, privacy-first planning tools designed for Indian families.</p>

        <div class="cross-grid">
          <a href="/tools/retirement" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">🌅</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">Retirement Accumulation Planner</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Calculate how much corpus you need to save before retirement and your monthly SIP roadmap.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/tools/retirement-distribution" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">⏳</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">Retirement Distribution Planner</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Structure your post-retirement corpus across liquidity, safety, and wealth creation buckets.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/tools/home-purchase" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">🏠</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">Home Purchase Planner</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Plan property appreciation, down payment, acquisition costs, and monthly EMI affordability.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/tools/life-insurance" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">🛡️</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">Life Insurance Need Analysis</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Calculate your family's true term insurance protection gap factoring living expenses and debts.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/plan/children" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">🎓</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">Children's Future Planner</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Map your child's higher education and marriage milestones with inflation and step-up SIPs.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/health-check/real-statement" class="cross-card">
            <span class="cross-icon">💎</span>
            <div class="cross-info">
              <h3 class="cross-card-title">REAL Financial Statement</h3>
              <p class="cross-card-desc">Audit your income, living costs, ongoing savings, and calculate your true family net worth.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="cross-arrow">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .sip-page-main {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 100vh;
    background-color: #F8FAFC;
    color: #00182A;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb-container {
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem 0.5rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb-nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb-link {
    color: #64748B;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .breadcrumb-link:hover {
    color: #00AB96;
  }

  .breadcrumb-sep {
    color: #94A3B8;
  }

  .breadcrumb-current {
    color: #00182A;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Header Section */
  .sip-header-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00182A 0%, #002B49 100%);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .sip-header-inner {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .sip-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(0, 171, 150, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 171, 150, 0.4);
    color: #00AB96;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .sip-main-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .sip-main-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #CBD5E1;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem 0;
  }

  .trust-perks-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .trust-perk {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #E2E8F0;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .perk-icon {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  /* Calculator Container */
  .calculator-container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Educational Guide Section */
  .edu-guide-section {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .edu-inner {
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .edu-badge {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: #00AB96;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .edu-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #00182A;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .edu-intro {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .edu-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .edu-card {
    background: #F8FAFC;
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.75rem;
  }

  .edu-icon {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .edu-card-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #00182A;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .edu-card-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Cross Discovery */
  .cross-discovery-section {
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .cross-inner {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cross-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #00182A;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .cross-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #64748B;
    margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
  }

  .cross-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .cross-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1.5px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cross-card:hover {
    border-color: #00AB96;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px -4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }

  .cross-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cross-info {
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .cross-card-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #00182A;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
  }

  .cross-card-desc {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #64748B;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .cross-arrow {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #00AB96;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .cross-card:hover .cross-arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .sip-main-title {
      font-size: 1.85rem;
    }
    .sip-header-section {
      padding: 2.25rem 1rem 2rem;
    }
    .trust-perks-row {
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    .edu-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .cross-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
